OL,3,ADo you know the lone, crying Oasis fan?
OL,4,AThe search is on by film-makers to find
OL,5,Ahim
OL,6,
OL,7,FReflecting on the opening gig at the
OL,8,FPrincipality Stadium, Southern said:
OL,9,F"That lad in particular is amazing
OL,10,Fbecause he's just had the experience of
OL,11,Fhis life and he doesn't know what to do
OL,12,Fwith it. And we want to find him."
OL,14,FHe went on to say: "What it resulted in
OL,15,Fand what we didn't expect is a music
OL,16,Fdocumentary that's actually a feel-good
OL,17,Ffilm."
